{"concept_id":"global-memory-coalescing","content_sha256":"sha256:3199f6a39279f35217be72c1e367e7d7ce431dae83fdae7ea4d3e502080919cd","correct_option_ids":["a"],"domain":"operator-development","explanation":"连续且对齐的线程访问更容易被硬件合并为较少的内存事务；它不自动解决分支、寄存器或同步问题。","id":"q-company-cuda-coalescing-001","options":[{"id":"a","text":"合并全局内存访问，减少事务数量并提高有效带宽"},{"id":"b","text":"自动减少寄存器使用"},{"id":"c","text":"保证所有分支无 divergence"},{"id":"d","text":"让 kernel 不需要同步"}],"prompt":"CUDA kernel 中，一个 warp 的线程按连续地址读取 float 数组，通常最有利于什么？","schema_version":"question/v1","skill":"optimization","source_refs":[{"kind":"official_docs","title":"CUDA C Programming Guide: Device Memory Accesses","url":"https://docs.nvidia.com/cuda/cuda-c-programming-guide/index.html#device-memory-accesses"},{"kind":"public_interview_topic","title":"Inference Engineer interview topic synthesis","url":"https://www.deep-ml.com/interview-prep/inference-engineer-general?role=inference-engineer&tab=path"}],"status":"enabled","topic":"cuda-memory","type":"single_choice","wiki_refs":[]}
